From: Petr Wozniak <petr.wozniak@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] map-controller: persist the backhaul MLD (bstamld chain)

Adds the controller half of the backhaul MLD chain: the bstamld holder and its
free path, the bSTA-MLD Config TLV parser, the 0x47 handler and ftable entry,
the 0xE1 sibling on Topology Response, the mapc_sync block, and the bstamld /
affiliated_bsta tables in the embedded schema.

Rescued from the 2026-07-16 control-plane work (tag
backhaul-mld-controlplane-2026-07-16) and re-applied 2026-07-22. The archived
apply script also carried four reverts of the broken 953 capstone; those were
skipped because 953 is not in this tree. The schema anchor had to be moved:
the string now ends with the agent_backhaul view from patch 973, not the table
the 2026-07-16 anchor expected.

Signed-off-by: Petr Wozniak <petr.wozniak@gmail.com>
---
